# Implementation Plan - Embedded Wallet & Privy/Para Auth Integration

Integrating embedded MPC wallet authentication into Advance following the Monskills wallet-integration architecture:
- **Zero Seed Phrase Onboarding**: Sellers and Lenders sign up via clean Email, Mobile Number, or Social Login. An embedded MPC wallet is automatically created in the background.
- **Connect Existing Wallet Option**: Provides a dedicated "Connect Existing External Wallet" option (MetaMask, Coinbase, WalletConnect, Rainbow) for experienced Web3 users.
- **Monad Testnet Auto-Wiring**: Automatically configures `monadTestnet` (Chain ID: 10143) with RPC transport and native balance display.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Embedded MPC Wallets**: Sellers and Lenders never see or manage seed phrases. Signing up via email/SMS automatically provisions a secure wallet.
> - **Dual Auth UI**: Onboarding forms feature:
>   1. **Email / Mobile Sign-Up**: Creates automatic embedded wallet.
>   2. **"Connect Existing Wallet"**: Allows connecting Web3 wallets for existing crypto users.

